        "title": "Loser",
        "text": "Plays when you are out: Equipment Failure, Hospital or Arrested. Out of money too? Bogus! That spring Beck's Loser was in the US top 10. Skitchin' (EA, 1994), Mega Drive / Genesis. Music by Jeff van Dyck."
